    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d622-a7">

                <pb facs="0736" n="650" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg650"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Carothers to Mr.
                            Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Torreon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-23"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Case in same status as before. Polte has done nothing to get his case before the
                    courts in proper form. See my letter of to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
